LPL unification description
	// This part describes the syntax in which the user should
	// complete the definition of the logic: i.e. how (s)he gives 
	// the specification.
  specification description
    part Vars	of sort list[identifier]
	 	modules sigSyntax
    part Ops	of sort list[pair[identifier,int]]
	 	modules sigSyntax
  end

	// This describes the way the user should gives the query 
	// and how it will be evaluated
  query 	of sort equation
         	result of sort eqSystem
	 	modules syntacticUnification[Vars,Ops]
			termVExt[Vars] termFExt[Ops]
         	start with (unify) query 

end of LPL description
